<InfoPage title="Commission and content policy">
  <p>This policy is a Phase 1 placeholder. Real commission intake is not yet open.</p>
  <h2>Baseline rules for the future service</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Requesters must be adults and able to consent to the requested service.</li>
    <li>The studio will not accept requests involving minors or age-ambiguous characters in sexual contexts.</li>
    <li>Character names or a source database do not establish adult eligibility; the studio will perform its own review.</li>
    <li>The studio may reject or cancel requests that conflict with its policies, applicable law, or platform/provider rules.</li>
    <li>Reference images will be collected through private uploads when the production system is ready; do not send untrusted links through this test site.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Before launch</h2>
  <p>The project owner must finalize prices, supported tiers, revision limits, turnaround expectations, cancellation/refund terms, and all legally required notices.</p>
</InfoPage>
